# Git Commit Message Template for Windows-AI

# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# <body>
#
# <footer>

# Type: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, chore
# Scope: component or file affected
# Subject: imperative, lowercase, no period
#
# Body: explain what and why vs. how
#
# Footer: reference issues, breaking changes
#
# Example:
# feat(agenthub): add proactive task prediction
#
# Implements ML-based prediction of user tasks based on behavioral patterns.
# Uses temporal analysis and context awareness for accurate suggestions.
#
# Closes #123
# BREAKING CHANGE: New API endpoint for predictions

# Branching Convention:
# - main: production-ready code
# - develop: integration branch
# - feature/*: new features
# - bugfix/*: bug fixes
# - hotfix/*: urgent production fixes
# - release/*: release preparation

# Review Checklist:
# [ ] Tests added/updated
# [ ] Documentation updated
# [ ] No breaking changes (or documented)
# [ ] Code follows style guide
# [ ] Security implications considered
